    "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Partner sign-in</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #222; background: #fff; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 16px; }\n  a { color: #0050a0; }\n  .skip, nav a, .solo { display: inline-block; padding: 12px; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  button, input, select, textarea, [role=\"button\"], [role=\"textbox\"], [role=\"radio\"], [role=\"link\"], [role=\"searchbox\"] {\n    display: inline-block; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1rem; }\n  input[type=\"checkbox\"], input[type=\"radio\"] { width: 44px; height: 44px; }\n  .visually-hidden { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Skip to main content</a>\n<header><p>Example Shop</p>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"/\" aria-current=\"page\">Home</a> <a href=\"/help\">Help</a></nav>\n</header>\n<main id=\"main\">\n<h1>Partner sign-in</h1>\n<!-- G2 #783 frames and shadow DOM for 3.3.8: a password field that blocks paste inside a web component or a same-origin frame fails like one in the top document. -->\n<div id=\"signin-widget\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"><style>input, button { min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; }</style><form action=\"/login\" method=\"post\"><p><label for=\"pw-shadow\">Password</label> <input id=\"pw-shadow\" name=\"pw\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" onpaste=\"return false\"></p><p><label for=\"pw-shadow-ok\">Repeat password</label> <input id=\"pw-shadow-ok\" name=\"pw2\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\"></p><p><button type=\"submit\">Sign in</button></p></form></template></div>\n<iframe id=\"signin-frame\" title=\"Partner sign-in form\" width=\"100%\" height=\"300\" srcdoc=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Partner sign-in form&lt;/title&gt;&lt;style&gt;\n  body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #222; background: #fff; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 16px; }\n  a { color: #0050a0; }\n  .skip, nav a, .solo { display: inline-block; padding: 12px; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  button, input, select, textarea, [role=&quot;button&quot;], [role=&quot;textbox&quot;], [role=&quot;radio&quot;], [role=&quot;link&quot;], [role=&quot;searchbox&quot;] {\n    display: inline-block; min-height: 44px; min-width: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 1rem; }\n  input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;], input[type=&quot;radio&quot;] { width: 44px; height: 44px; }\n  .visually-hidden { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }\n&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;main&gt;&lt;form action=&quot;/login&quot; method=&quot;post&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;pw-frame&quot;&gt;Password&lt;/label&gt; &lt;input id=&quot;pw-frame&quot; name=&quot;pw&quot; type=&quot;password&quot; autocomplete=&quot;current-password&quot; onpaste=&quot;return false&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;label for=&quot;pw-frame-ok&quot;&gt;Repeat password&lt;/label&gt; &lt;input id=&quot;pw-frame-ok&quot; name=&quot;pw2&quot; type=&quot;password&quot; autocomplete=&quot;current-password&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot;&gt;Sign in&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/main&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;\"></iframe>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Example Shop, 2026</p></footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
